window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Brought to you by Penguin.</b><br><br>Nobody remembers how the Causality War started. Really, there's no-one to remember, and nothing for them to remember if there were; that's sort of the point. We were time warriors, and we broke time.<br><br>I was the one who ended it. Ended the fighting, tidied up the damage as much as I could.<br><br>Then I came here, to the end of it all, and gave myself a mission: to never let it happen again.<br><br>© 2021 Adrian Czajkowski (P) Penguin Audio and Rebellion Publishing 2021</p>"; 
